Shirt sales: Gianluigi Donnarumma's arrival has boosted shirt sales: about £7.0m of extra commercial income so far (Finances › Shirt sales).
Blockbuster signing: Arsenal have completed the signing of Gianluigi Donnarumma (27, GK, ITA) from Man City for £120m. He signs a 5-year contract worth a reported £300k/w. Supporters gathered outside Emirates Stadium to welcome one of the biggest names in world football, and his name has been trending all day on WUPH.com. The club shop reported strong demand from the first morning: an estimated 318,000 shirts with his name on the back are expected to sell, worth about £7.0m to the club (game estimate). For Man City, it ends his time at the club; the fee is a major boost to their budget.
Transfer: Gianluigi Donnarumma completes a £120m move from Man City to Arsenal.
